{"title":"Illinois mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Illinois_elementary_school_mathematic_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Illinois elementary school mathematic competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Illinois_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Illinois middle school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Illinois_high_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Illinois high school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#National_math_contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National math contests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Illinois_elementary_school_mathematic_competitions\">Illinois elementary school mathematic competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Illinois_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Illinois elementary school mathematic competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Illinois Mathematics League -- 4th through 12th grade. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.mathleague.com/\">website</a></li>\n<li>Latin School of Chicago Math Contest -- 5th through 8th grade. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.latinschool.org/Page/Student-Life/Math-Contest\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ICTM_Math_Contest\" title=\"ICTM Math Contest\">ICTM Math Contest</a> -- <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ictm.org/contest.html\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Illinois_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\">Illinois middle school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Illinois_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Illinois middle school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3_middle_school_math\">middle school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Illinois_Mathcounts\" title=\"Illinois Mathcounts\">Illinois Mathcounts</a> is part of the national <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> contest.</li>\n<li>Illinois Mathematics League -- grades 4 through 12. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.mathleague.com/\">website</a></li>\n<li>Latin School of Chicago Math Contest -- 5th through 8th grade. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.latinschool.org/Page/Student-Life/Math-Contest\">website</a></li>\n<li>IMSA Junior High School Math Contest. (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://students.imsa.edu/org/mao/jhmc.php\">in-person division</a>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://imsajhmc.com\">virtual division</a> websites)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ICTM_Math_Contest\" title=\"ICTM Math Contest\">ICTM Math Contest</a> -- <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ictm.org/contest.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Illinois_Middle_School_Math_Olympiad\" title=\"Illinois Middle School Math Olympiad\">Illinois Middle School Math Olympiad</a> - <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ilmiddleschoolmo.org\">website here</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Illinois_high_school_mathematics_competitions\">Illinois high school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Illinois_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Illinois high school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c4_high_school_math\">high school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chicago_ARML\" title=\"Chicago ARML\">Chicago ARML</a> -- <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.chicagoarml.org/\">website</a></li>\n<li>City of Chicago Math League (CCML) -- <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ccmlmath.org/\">website</a></li>\n<li>Illinois Mathematics League -- grades 4 through 12. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.mathleague.com/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ICTM_Math_Contest\" title=\"ICTM Math Contest\">ICTM Math Contest</a> -- <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ictm.org/contest.html\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=North_Suburban_Mathematics_League\" title=\"North Suburban Mathematics League\">North Suburban Mathematics League</a> -- <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.nsml.org/\">website</a></li>\n<li>Southern Illinois University Math Field Day -- <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://math.siu.edu/mfd/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_math_contests\">National math contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Illinois_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: National math contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions\">List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States middle school mathematics competitions\">List of United States middle school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_high_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States high school mathematics competitions\">List of United States high school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Illinois_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c299\">Illinois forum on AoPS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions resources\">Mathematics competitions resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018090931\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 27/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1403:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018090931 and revision id 217360. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}